        "text": "<p>Clean drinking water shouldn’t require permanent installation or complex plumbing, and the <strong>iSpring CKC1 Countertop Water Filtration System</strong> is built with exactly that philosophy in mind. This countertop system uses a <strong>5-micron carbon block cartridge</strong> to effectively reduce up to <strong>95% of chlorine</strong>, along with unpleasant odors, sand, silt, sediment, and rust commonly found in municipal water supplies. The result is noticeably cleaner-tasting water without stripping away beneficial naturally occurring minerals. Unlike reverse osmosis systems that remove Total Dissolved Solids (TDS), the CKC1 focuses on <strong>chemical and particulate filtration</strong>, allowing essential minerals to remain in your drinking water. This approach appeals to users who want improved taste and safety without altering the mineral profile of their water.</p>",
